abstract: >-
  Evidence-tracked research software for exploring candidate mechanisms of
  belief formation, information processing, intervention priorities and
  epistemic-system dynamics. The current M0 specification is an uncalibrated
  reference model and does not provide population prevalence estimates or
  individual diagnoses.
